Source: pieboot
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Maxwell <maxwell@blueberrypieos.com>
Build-Depends: pietoolchain (>= 0.1.0), clang-20:native, lld-20:native, llvm-20:native
Standards-Version: 4.7.3
Homepage: https://github.com/blueberrypieos/pieboot
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/blueberrypieos/pieboot.git
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/blueberrypieos/pieboot
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: pieboot
Architecture: darwin-arm64
Priority: required
Description: boot shim that starts xnu from arm64 Linux-style boot firmware
 pieboot.bin is installed in /usr/lib/blueberry-pie-os/boot. It is loaded as
 a Linux arm64 kernel, converts the firmware's device tree and starts xnu
 from the initrd.
